1
00:00:01,135 --> 00:00:02,503
(This drama merged facts with fiction
and plots may differ from records.)

2
00:00:02,569 --> 00:00:03,904
(Children and animals were filmed
with the aid of guardians and experts.)

3
00:00:03,971 --> 00:00:04,972
(Some scenes were made
using generative AI.)

4
00:00:06,173 --> 00:00:08,776
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

5
00:00:34,768 --> 00:00:37,204
Juk Juk, what are you staring at?

6
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:41,074
- It is nothing, sir.
- It is all right, so speak your mind.

7
00:00:41,809 --> 00:00:43,177
(Juk Juk, Silla's official)

8
00:00:43,243 --> 00:00:45,045
Seeing you today, General,

9
00:00:45,112 --> 00:00:48,182
reminds me of how you led us
at Okmungok Valley four years ago.

10
00:00:48,816 --> 00:00:51,351
(Kim Pum Seok, lord of Daeyaseong,
Kim Chun Chu's son-in-law)

11
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,855
You must stay alert as well.

12
00:00:55,456 --> 00:00:57,891
From now on,
we will begin rigorous training.

13
00:01:01,628 --> 00:01:04,431
We will protect this fortress
no matter what.

14
00:01:04,932 --> 00:01:05,933
Yes, General.

15
00:01:14,408 --> 00:01:18,345
Looking at that river,
I wonder if this is truly a battlefield.

16
00:01:24,051 --> 00:01:25,819
Is life here difficult for you?

17
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:29,289
(Kim Go Ta So, Kim Pum Seok's wife,
Kim Chun Chu's daughter)

18
00:01:29,356 --> 00:01:31,592
It cannot be as hard as it is
for our father,

19
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:33,494
who is traveling everywhere
for our nation.

20
00:01:37,664 --> 00:01:38,699
I am sorry...

21
00:01:38,765 --> 00:01:40,000
(Kim Beop Min, Kim Chun Chu's eldest son)

22
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,035
that you got married in my stead.

23
00:01:46,673 --> 00:01:49,042
Are you crying again, Brother?

24
00:01:54,481 --> 00:01:58,418
I have been blessed with lovely children
under such a clear sky.

25
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:02,656
I am happy, Brother.

26
00:02:06,994 --> 00:02:10,831
Are you still wandering, Brother?

27
00:02:14,935 --> 00:02:16,937
Do I look pathetic to you as well?

28
00:02:19,273 --> 00:02:22,976
You resemble our father very much.

29
00:02:24,444 --> 00:02:25,879
I take after Father?

30
00:02:27,114 --> 00:02:31,118
You hide your true feelings
and agonize over things.

31
00:02:31,184 --> 00:02:34,521
You may look cold, but I know
you are more passionate than anyone.

32
00:02:35,556 --> 00:02:36,823
I know that one day,

33
00:02:37,824 --> 00:02:41,562
you will make up your mind.

34
00:02:43,130 --> 00:02:46,567
So for now, just follow your heart.

35
00:03:03,383 --> 00:03:05,385
What is this?

36
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,388
Did I not tell you recently?

37
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:11,291
I brought it because I thought
it would suit you well.

38
00:03:26,239 --> 00:03:27,441
How do I look?

39
00:03:28,542 --> 00:03:29,543
Is it pretty?

40
00:03:29,943 --> 00:03:30,944
It is beautiful.

41
00:03:32,846 --> 00:03:33,880
You look lovely.

42
00:03:39,019 --> 00:03:41,421
What are you two talking about so happily?

43
00:03:42,789 --> 00:03:45,792
About how my brother is becoming
just like you, Father.

44
00:03:46,326 --> 00:03:48,328
(Kim Chun Chu,
Silla's Minister of Military Affairs)

45
00:03:49,296 --> 00:03:52,532
Once the army arrives here from Seorabeol,

46
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:57,204
you will be able to return to Seorabeol.

47
00:03:58,739 --> 00:04:02,609
When you return, we shall all go
see the flowers as a family.

48
00:04:03,310 --> 00:04:06,446
Soon, the flowers on Mount Namsan
behind Wolseong will be in full bloom.

49
00:04:07,381 --> 00:04:08,515
Is that for sure?

50
00:04:10,651 --> 00:04:13,420
And after speaking
with General Kim Pum Seok,

51
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:17,190
it seems there will be no issues
defending this fortress for now.

52
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:22,362
Do you really think so, Father?

53
00:04:23,163 --> 00:04:24,865
Actually, I felt it too.

54
00:04:25,465 --> 00:04:28,035
The General has changed somehow.

55
00:04:29,670 --> 00:04:31,171
Grandpa is right.

56
00:04:33,306 --> 00:04:35,575
Yes, you are right.

57
00:04:36,043 --> 00:04:41,181
My, this little one is starting
to look just like him.

58
00:04:43,583 --> 00:04:46,353
I have never seen you smile so brightly.

59
00:04:46,420 --> 00:04:48,055
Shall we catch butterflies?

60
00:04:48,121 --> 00:04:49,156
Shall we?

61
00:05:00,067 --> 00:05:02,602
(Sabiseong, Baekje, modern-day Buyeo)

62
00:05:07,574 --> 00:05:10,143
(To King Uija)

63
00:05:12,112 --> 00:05:14,681
(King Uija, 31st ruler of Baekje)

64
00:05:22,522 --> 00:05:23,523
(Goguryeo)

65
00:05:23,590 --> 00:05:26,126
I heard the ruler of Goguryeo has changed.

66
00:05:26,193 --> 00:05:29,996
Yeon Gae So Mun staged a coup
and took control of Goguryeo.

67
00:05:30,097 --> 00:05:32,499
It was sent by Minister Seong Chung.

68
00:05:32,566 --> 00:05:34,501
Ko Geon Mu is dead.

69
00:05:37,537 --> 00:05:41,475
The heavens have finally given me...

70
00:05:42,409 --> 00:05:45,512
a chance to destroy Silla.

71
00:05:46,046 --> 00:05:47,547
Yeon Gae So Mun is ambitious,

72
00:05:47,614 --> 00:05:51,518
unlike Ko Geon Mu, who repeatedly delayed
Your Majesty's peace proposals.

73
00:05:51,585 --> 00:05:52,586
I am certain...

74
00:05:54,154 --> 00:05:58,125
that he will be inclined
to destroy the weak Silla first.

75
00:05:59,559 --> 00:06:00,560
(Sang Yeong, Baekje's general)

76
00:06:00,627 --> 00:06:02,262
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

77
00:06:02,329 --> 00:06:05,699
This is finally our chance
to annihilate Silla.

78
00:06:06,166 --> 00:06:10,036
You can conquer Daeyaseong
and enter Seorabeol in a single stroke.

79
00:06:25,352 --> 00:06:26,720
(Dangseong Fortress)

80
00:06:27,521 --> 00:06:28,522
Dangseong...

81
00:06:28,588 --> 00:06:29,589
(Dangseong, modern-day Hwaseong)

82
00:06:29,656 --> 00:06:30,657
Dangseong!

83
00:06:32,192 --> 00:06:34,227
It is an unexpected strategic point,
Your Majesty!

84
00:06:35,362 --> 00:06:39,499
Daeyaseong is a natural fortress,
making cooperation with Goguryeo hard,

85
00:06:39,566 --> 00:06:43,270
but a pincer attack is possible
at Dangseong Fortress, is it not?

86
00:06:43,870 --> 00:06:45,105
If Dangseong is cut off,

87
00:06:45,172 --> 00:06:47,440
Silla cannot send envoys
to the Tang Dynasty,

88
00:06:47,974 --> 00:06:49,442
nor will they be able to trade.

89
00:06:51,645 --> 00:06:55,849
They will be completely trapped
like rats in a jar!

90
00:07:02,189 --> 00:07:06,560
The time has come
to utilize the power of Goguryeo.

91
00:07:07,427 --> 00:07:09,529
I will order our minister
in Pyongyangseong...

92
00:07:09,596 --> 00:07:12,098
to ensure
that the pincer attack is successful.

93
00:07:13,533 --> 00:07:18,672
We will seize Dangseong with Goguryeo,
cutting Silla's path to the West Sea,

94
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,676
and carve out its heart...

95
00:07:24,211 --> 00:07:27,914
so that it can never rise again.

96
00:07:27,981 --> 00:07:29,950
Silla will be destroyed,

97
00:07:30,016 --> 00:07:32,118
and your era is not far off.

98
00:07:32,185 --> 00:07:34,054
- That is correct, Your Majesty!
- Yes, Your Majesty!

99
00:07:38,358 --> 00:07:41,895
(Episode 3: The Die is Cast)

100
00:08:01,181 --> 00:08:04,451
You are asking me
to attack Silla with you.

101
00:08:05,252 --> 00:08:06,386
Indeed.

102
00:08:07,087 --> 00:08:09,289
If Goguryeo and Baekje work together,

103
00:08:09,356 --> 00:08:11,892
Silla will lose Dangseong Fortress
in an instant.

104
00:08:19,065 --> 00:08:20,100
Circumstances...

105
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:21,334
(Yeon Gae So Mun,
Goguryeo's Grand Chancellor)

106
00:08:21,401 --> 00:08:24,738
are always subject to change,
Lord Seong Chung.

107
00:08:25,405 --> 00:08:27,974
(Seong Chung, envoy from Baekje)

108
00:08:28,608 --> 00:08:34,047
Do you know
the current situation of Goguryeo?

109
00:08:35,081 --> 00:08:39,219
Are you not currently rectifying the chaos
in Goguryeo, Supreme Commander?

110
00:08:41,421 --> 00:08:43,523
I meant the Goguryeo that was in chaos.

111
00:08:45,959 --> 00:08:48,061
The chaos in Goguryeo...

112
00:08:58,571 --> 00:09:00,507
Despite knowing the situation,

113
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:06,012
you seem more interested in my troops
than in worrying about Goguryeo.

114
00:09:06,112 --> 00:09:10,550
The mere deployment of Goguryeo's army
will cause great chaos in Silla.

115
00:09:10,617 --> 00:09:14,721
If Silla is destroyed,
it will be of great benefit to you.

116
00:09:21,227 --> 00:09:25,465
What is it that you want,
Supreme Commander?

117
00:09:25,532 --> 00:09:27,300
If you would only provide the troops...

118
00:09:29,903 --> 00:09:32,605
If the Goguryeo army sets out,

119
00:09:34,474 --> 00:09:36,977
what will you give me in return?

120
00:09:38,478 --> 00:09:41,815
- All hail, the Baekje army!
- All hail, the Baekje army!

121
00:09:41,881 --> 00:09:43,416
(Land of Baekje,
south of Dangseong, Silla)

122
00:09:45,151 --> 00:09:49,022
- All hail, the Baekje army!
- All hail, the Baekje army!

123
00:09:49,089 --> 00:09:51,224
They are aiming for Dangseong.

124
00:09:51,291 --> 00:09:52,926
We must inform the beacon tower quickly.

125
00:09:52,993 --> 00:09:54,361
- Let us do so.
- Yes, sir.

126
00:10:07,741 --> 00:10:09,776
Goodness, I am so sick of this.

127
00:10:09,843 --> 00:10:12,812
Why do those beacons go up
at all hours of the day?

128
00:10:12,879 --> 00:10:14,347
Darn it!

129
00:10:15,815 --> 00:10:17,851
Make way! I am a messenger!

130
00:10:25,025 --> 00:10:26,860
They say the beacon started
from Dangseong.

131
00:10:26,926 --> 00:10:27,927
Dangseong Fortress?

132
00:10:28,762 --> 00:10:29,929
But how could...

133
00:10:33,199 --> 00:10:35,235
A large Baekje army is
heading toward Dangseong,

134
00:10:35,301 --> 00:10:36,870
and troops have also emerged
from Pyongyangseong.

135
00:10:36,936 --> 00:10:37,937
What?

136
00:10:38,171 --> 00:10:41,307
- Did Goguryeo deploy its troops?
- No, how could Ko Geon Mu...

137
00:10:41,374 --> 00:10:44,344
I heard Yeon Gae So Mun killed the King
and took over the throne.

138
00:10:49,416 --> 00:10:50,483
We cannot delay any longer.

139
00:10:51,684 --> 00:10:53,253
I must return to Seorabeol at once.

140
00:10:53,319 --> 00:10:54,320
Get ready.

141
00:10:57,924 --> 00:10:59,392
What are you doing?

142
00:10:59,459 --> 00:11:01,861
I told you to get ready
to return to Seorabeol immediately!

143
00:11:08,334 --> 00:11:10,036
Take good care of your father.

144
00:11:10,103 --> 00:11:13,006
I swear to protect this fortress
at all costs.

145
00:11:13,907 --> 00:11:15,008
Do not worry.

146
00:11:18,945 --> 00:11:20,013
Grandpa.

147
00:12:02,755 --> 00:12:06,626
I will defend this place until the end,
so do not worry and go save Silla.

148
00:12:09,429 --> 00:12:12,165
All right, I will see you soon.

149
00:12:56,943 --> 00:12:58,611
(Kim Jin Ju, Silla's general, a Jingol)

150
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:02,649
Have all 2,000 troops assembled?

151
00:13:02,715 --> 00:13:03,850
Yes, General!

152
00:13:05,785 --> 00:13:07,487
I have seen my future.

153
00:13:08,154 --> 00:13:11,925
I will surely protect this nation!

154
00:13:12,825 --> 00:13:14,227
I will not die.

155
00:13:16,529 --> 00:13:17,630
And you will not die either.

156
00:13:19,098 --> 00:13:21,134
(Kim Jin Heum, Silla's commander,
Kim Jin Ju's younger brother)

157
00:13:23,436 --> 00:13:25,972
Long live, General Kim Jin Ju!

158
00:13:26,072 --> 00:13:27,807
- Long live the general!
- Long live the general!

159
00:13:29,142 --> 00:13:30,143
Let us go!

160
00:13:30,210 --> 00:13:31,377
- Yes, General!
- Yes, General!

161
00:13:38,484 --> 00:13:40,653
What on earth are you doing?

162
00:13:42,355 --> 00:13:45,558
Do you ask because you do not know?
I am on my way to protect our nation.

163
00:13:46,926 --> 00:13:50,530
My friend Jin Ju,
this nation will not fall that easily.

164
00:13:55,468 --> 00:13:58,171
The Queen's time is just coming to an end.

165
00:14:01,641 --> 00:14:03,643
Are you truly planning to oppose me?

166
00:14:07,847 --> 00:14:11,751
I love Silla,
but I do not want to lose you.

167
00:14:15,455 --> 00:14:18,992
- Stand by for now.
- Stand by!

168
00:14:19,459 --> 00:14:20,460
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

169
00:14:36,442 --> 00:14:37,477
(Queen Seondeok, 27th ruler of Silla)

170
00:14:37,577 --> 00:14:41,080
- Who is protecting Dangseong...
- Beacons rise from the Baekje border.

171
00:14:41,748 --> 00:14:43,216
And we were in the dark...

172
00:14:43,283 --> 00:14:46,986
until refugees from Goguryeo brought news
of Yeon Gae So Mun's deployment.

173
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:50,089
The absurd decisions made
by the Minister of Military Affairs...

174
00:14:50,156 --> 00:14:54,394
and his act of abandoning Seorabeol
is unforgivable!

175
00:14:54,694 --> 00:14:55,728
That is correct.

176
00:14:55,795 --> 00:15:00,800
- He is correct.
- Punish him.

177
00:15:00,867 --> 00:15:04,270
Dangseong is the lifeline of Silla.

178
00:15:05,471 --> 00:15:06,706
If we lose Dangseong,

179
00:15:07,540 --> 00:15:10,777
all communication with Tang will be
cut off, and we will be isolated.

180
00:15:11,244 --> 00:15:13,613
We will be left with nothing
but to wait for death.

181
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,282
We must protect Dangseong.

182
00:15:16,349 --> 00:15:19,118
Your Majesty,
your words are absolutely correct,

183
00:15:19,952 --> 00:15:24,691
but our swords are far too small to stop
the massive armies of the two nations.

184
00:15:25,692 --> 00:15:30,530
Baekje has 20,000,
and Goguryeo has at least 50,000 troops.

185
00:15:31,864 --> 00:15:35,034
- This is bad news.
- What should we do?

186
00:15:35,702 --> 00:15:39,138
But we cannot just sit back
and do nothing, can we?

187
00:15:39,205 --> 00:15:41,107
We must do whatever we can.

188
00:15:42,308 --> 00:15:45,111
Who will go and stop them?

189
00:15:56,756 --> 00:15:58,191
General Su Se.

190
00:15:58,257 --> 00:16:01,594
Your Majesty,
my troops are but old soldiers.

191
00:16:02,061 --> 00:16:04,630
They cannot possibly face
the Goguryeo cavalry.

192
00:16:07,533 --> 00:16:09,402
I do not see General Jin Bok.

193
00:16:09,669 --> 00:16:13,940
I heard General Jin Bok is unable
to move due to a stroke.

194
00:16:18,678 --> 00:16:20,113
Lord Yeom Jong.

195
00:16:20,179 --> 00:16:23,850
I only have
a ragtag group of private soldiers,

196
00:16:23,916 --> 00:16:26,619
so I am not fit to step forward.

197
00:16:31,357 --> 00:16:36,329
Among all these generals,
there is no one to protect the nation.

198
00:16:39,065 --> 00:16:40,066
Your Majesty.

199
00:16:41,734 --> 00:16:44,537
General Kim Yu Sin is stationed
on the outskirts of Seorabeol, is he not?

200
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,575
Give that fierce general 10,000 troops...

201
00:16:49,642 --> 00:16:52,111
and have him face
the armies of both nations.

202
00:16:54,247 --> 00:16:55,314
Are you suggesting...

203
00:16:56,783 --> 00:16:59,352
to have General Yu Sin stop
the armies of two nations on his own?

204
00:17:01,654 --> 00:17:06,259
Kim Yu Sin is the one who defeated
the Baekje army with only old soldiers.

205
00:17:13,399 --> 00:17:19,972
If we end up losing Kim Yu Sin,
what will become of this nation?

206
00:17:21,307 --> 00:17:25,745
He wants us to face two nations
with only 10,000 troops.

207
00:17:26,145 --> 00:17:29,515
Bi Dam is trying to kill you
without getting his own hands dirty.

208
00:17:29,582 --> 00:17:32,285
With the private soldiers in Seorabeol,
we would have 30,000 troops.

209
00:17:32,351 --> 00:17:33,386
(Juk Ji, Silla's general, a Jingol)

210
00:17:33,453 --> 00:17:34,654
Why will they not send them?

211
00:17:36,722 --> 00:17:38,491
- Heum Sun.
- Yes, General.

212
00:17:38,558 --> 00:17:42,295
Take 5,000 men with you
and head to Dangseong.

213
00:17:42,361 --> 00:17:45,064
You must ride day and night to Dangseong.

214
00:17:45,131 --> 00:17:49,168
- You must protect Dangseong Fortress.
- Yes, I will keep that in mind.

215
00:17:49,235 --> 00:17:54,474
Mun Yeong, lead 3,000 infantry
and head to the Goguryeo border.

216
00:17:54,540 --> 00:17:57,877
I will pin down Yeon Gae So Mun first,
but if the situation worsens,

217
00:17:57,977 --> 00:18:00,246
you will head to Dangseong
and join Heum Sun.

218
00:18:00,313 --> 00:18:02,882
I will send messengers from time to time.

219
00:18:02,949 --> 00:18:04,584
I will follow your orders!

220
00:18:05,985 --> 00:18:11,290
I will leave for the Goguryeo border
with 2,000 cavalry now.

221
00:18:13,226 --> 00:18:16,963
If Yeon Gae So Mun's armored cavalry
meets with Baekje,

222
00:18:18,664 --> 00:18:20,166
our Silla is finished.

223
00:18:22,735 --> 00:18:23,936
General Kim.

224
00:18:24,003 --> 00:18:25,438
Do you intend...

225
00:18:25,505 --> 00:18:27,373
to stop Yeon Gae So Mun's 50,000
with just 2,000 men?

226
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:29,242
If we fought by numbers,

227
00:18:29,308 --> 00:18:30,877
we would be dead already.

228
00:18:30,943 --> 00:18:33,112
If we catch the enemy off guard
and use the terrain,

229
00:18:33,179 --> 00:18:35,615
2,000 can do the work of 20,000.

230
00:18:36,349 --> 00:18:41,220
General, if you lose without even getting
a proper chance to fight Yeon Gae So Mun,

231
00:18:41,721 --> 00:18:42,788
that would be disgraceful.

232
00:18:45,191 --> 00:18:48,461
I will surely die from that disgrace.

233
00:18:52,365 --> 00:18:53,366
I will go.

234
00:18:59,872 --> 00:19:04,043
Why would I hand over the fun
of fighting Yeon Gae So Mun to you?

235
00:19:04,911 --> 00:19:07,613
A fight is meant for the enemy.

236
00:19:08,481 --> 00:19:12,685
Pour your anger into the enemy
and cast away your anxiety.

237
00:19:16,722 --> 00:19:19,825
This battle must be won.

238
00:19:20,826 --> 00:19:24,130
Men, let us consider ourselves
the last soldiers of Silla and fight!

239
00:19:24,196 --> 00:19:27,066
All units, march!

240
00:19:27,133 --> 00:19:28,968
- Yes, General!
- Yes, General!

241
00:19:29,035 --> 00:19:32,438
Kim Yu Sin's troops shall protect Silla!

242
00:19:32,505 --> 00:19:35,741
- Protect the country!
- Protect the country!

243
00:19:35,808 --> 00:19:41,681
- Long live, Kim Yu Sin! Long live, Silla!
- Long live, Kim Yu Sin! Long live, Silla!

244
00:19:42,348 --> 00:19:44,684
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

245
00:20:00,666 --> 00:20:05,805
Namu barabaljae palayang baramidaye...

246
00:20:06,772 --> 00:20:10,576
Om irijeo isinri suroda...

247
00:20:13,179 --> 00:20:16,515
Bisaya bisaya saba...

248
00:20:47,713 --> 00:20:50,282
(Geom Il, Silla's official)

249
00:21:16,842 --> 00:21:19,278
How far do we have left
until the Goguryeo border?

250
00:21:20,413 --> 00:21:21,781
Less than 12km remain.

251
00:21:25,284 --> 00:21:28,721
Advance at full speed.

252
00:21:29,588 --> 00:21:31,724
Advance at full speed!

253
00:22:13,399 --> 00:22:14,400
Father.

254
00:22:14,967 --> 00:22:16,736
I am worried about Go Ta So.

255
00:22:17,503 --> 00:22:19,271
I will go back to Daeyaseong.

256
00:22:20,206 --> 00:22:23,109
No, you must help me.

257
00:22:23,876 --> 00:22:25,778
We need all the help we can get.

258
00:22:28,881 --> 00:22:31,550
I know your hidden talents.

259
00:22:31,617 --> 00:22:33,419
You are also quite skilled with the sword.

260
00:22:35,755 --> 00:22:36,756
No matter what I am good at,

261
00:22:37,490 --> 00:22:39,225
the only person I want to protect
is my sister.

262
00:22:40,659 --> 00:22:44,864
Daeyaseong is precious,
but Silla is wider.

263
00:22:44,930 --> 00:22:47,666
And Goguryeo, which is beyond it,
is a bigger world.

264
00:22:48,667 --> 00:22:50,069
Look at the wider world.

265
00:22:51,403 --> 00:22:52,805
Is it not more important...

266
00:22:52,872 --> 00:22:55,541
to protect the person you hold dear
than to see the world?

267
00:22:57,576 --> 00:22:58,911
Let us trust Kim Pum Seok.

268
00:22:59,845 --> 00:23:02,915
Right now,
we must do what needs to be done.

269
00:23:03,816 --> 00:23:04,817
Ah Jin Ham.

270
00:23:05,151 --> 00:23:07,386
- We must hurry.
- Yes, sir!

271
00:23:08,020 --> 00:23:10,289
Increase the speed to Seorabeol!

272
00:23:10,356 --> 00:23:13,092
- Yes, sir!
- Now, let us go!

273
00:23:25,037 --> 00:23:27,606
(Silla-Goguryeo border)

274
00:23:33,078 --> 00:23:35,781
- General Kim.
- Where is Yeon Gae So Mun?

275
00:23:35,848 --> 00:23:38,818
There has been no news
since the vanguard appeared two days ago.

276
00:23:38,918 --> 00:23:41,086
- They are the only ones.
- What?

277
00:23:44,957 --> 00:23:46,492
It is a feint.

278
00:23:48,761 --> 00:23:50,396
Where are they, then?

279
00:23:52,665 --> 00:23:54,466
Fire!

280
00:23:54,834 --> 00:23:56,936
(Daeyaseong, Silla, modern-day Hapcheon)

281
00:23:57,002 --> 00:23:58,003
- Hey!
- Help!

282
00:24:06,378 --> 00:24:08,214
Fire!

283
00:24:11,183 --> 00:24:12,351
Light this house on fire.

284
00:24:26,765 --> 00:24:29,702
The grain and weapon warehouses
are all on fire!

285
00:24:29,768 --> 00:24:32,438
- Bring General Kim Pum Seok here. Hurry!
- Yes, sir.

286
00:24:50,222 --> 00:24:51,490
If we had gone to Dangseong,

287
00:24:53,292 --> 00:24:55,761
it would have been a difficult battle.

288
00:24:57,997 --> 00:24:59,131
As I thought,

289
00:25:01,300 --> 00:25:03,135
the heavens are on my side.

290
00:25:05,271 --> 00:25:07,006
Yeon Gae So Mun,

291
00:25:09,408 --> 00:25:10,743
just what kind of man are you?

292
00:25:23,355 --> 00:25:27,559
Kim Yu Sin of Silla is at the border,
and Baekje has attacked Silla.

293
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:32,231
King Uija has cleverly found
a place to attack.

294
00:25:34,166 --> 00:25:36,568
If the Goguryeo army sets out,

295
00:25:40,272 --> 00:25:42,641
what will you give me in return?

296
00:25:46,045 --> 00:25:47,046
I will return...

297
00:25:48,314 --> 00:25:51,750
the territories north of Jungnyeong
that Silla took from Goguryeo,

298
00:25:52,685 --> 00:25:56,422
and send enough grain
for 50,000 troops to last for a month.

299
00:25:59,692 --> 00:26:03,462
How will you give away the land of Silla?

300
00:26:05,197 --> 00:26:10,636
Just for the Silla army to fall into chaos
by Goguryeo's deployment.

301
00:26:13,772 --> 00:26:15,908
Is that not what you said?

302
00:26:18,010 --> 00:26:19,011
That is correct.

303
00:26:20,045 --> 00:26:23,382
Then I will only deploy the troops,

304
00:26:23,449 --> 00:26:29,021
and I will use every means
to make Silla believe that I am attacking.

305
00:26:29,989 --> 00:26:31,156
In return,

306
00:26:33,192 --> 00:26:35,961
give me enough grain to feed...

307
00:26:37,529 --> 00:26:39,465
50,000 troops for a year.

308
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:48,841
Go to King Uija...

309
00:26:49,641 --> 00:26:53,078
- and bring back the grain he promised us.
- Yes, sir!

310
00:27:01,053 --> 00:27:03,322
- Fire!
- It is on fire!

311
00:27:04,289 --> 00:27:06,725
We have a traitor. Guard the gates!

312
00:27:37,222 --> 00:27:38,490
Are the grain warehouses burned down?

313
00:27:38,557 --> 00:27:40,926
The grain and weapon warehouses
have all been burned to the ground.

314
00:27:41,493 --> 00:27:44,696
- Have they crossed the river?
- Not yet.

315
00:27:44,763 --> 00:27:48,934
This was an inside job.
Who is responsible for this?

316
00:27:59,778 --> 00:28:00,846
Geom Il!

317
00:28:07,686 --> 00:28:09,588
- How dare you?
- Consider yourself lucky.

318
00:28:10,556 --> 00:28:13,725
Everything is burned,
so there will be no rations left.

319
00:28:14,359 --> 00:28:18,263
General Yun Chung of Great Baekje
says if you abandon the fortress,

320
00:28:18,363 --> 00:28:19,631
he will not pursue you.

321
00:28:19,698 --> 00:28:20,699
How dare you!

322
00:28:24,136 --> 00:28:27,206
Do you think I am the only one
who started the fire?

323
00:28:30,809 --> 00:28:32,411
Do you think your wife is safe?

324
00:28:37,516 --> 00:28:40,919
Please let the general keep
his courage until the end.

325
00:29:14,887 --> 00:29:16,955
Father, that is Daeyaseong.

326
00:29:23,896 --> 00:29:28,200
Everyone's desires and hatred
have turned into flames,

327
00:29:28,667 --> 00:29:34,640
pushing the Three Kingdoms into smoke
where nothing could be foreseen.

328
00:29:38,076 --> 00:29:42,214
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong
bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

329
00:29:42,281 --> 00:29:46,351
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong
bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

330
00:29:46,418 --> 00:29:53,425
Seongje unsaengja biyeongnang siljeong
bichijegi jecha cheomaknyujeong...

331
00:29:54,159 --> 00:29:58,764
Brother, the situation in Daeyaseong
seems to be getting urgent.

332
00:30:00,299 --> 00:30:02,301
As Minister of Military Affairs,
Kim Chun Chu ordered...

333
00:30:02,701 --> 00:30:05,637
to check the number of private soldiers
in every family.

334
00:30:10,409 --> 00:30:14,780
Goodness. I wonder if they are planning
to take our private soldiers away.

335
00:30:14,846 --> 00:30:16,481
If they want them that badly, let them.

336
00:30:17,182 --> 00:30:19,484
There are plenty of people
to fill the vacancies.

337
00:30:21,987 --> 00:30:25,390
No, that will only provoke Bi Dam's anger.

338
00:30:29,494 --> 00:30:30,495
Okay.

339
00:31:37,429 --> 00:31:38,430
Do you see the future?

340
00:31:41,566 --> 00:31:46,204
Now, what is the fortune
of Kim Chun Chu and Bi Dam?

341
00:31:47,572 --> 00:31:50,575
Kim Chun Chu is
like the midnight darkness,

342
00:31:51,576 --> 00:31:55,247
and Bi Dam shines as brightly
as the midday sun.

343
00:32:02,487 --> 00:32:05,490
The darkness is more appealing now,

344
00:32:06,925 --> 00:32:09,461
and my intuition has never been wrong.

345
00:32:10,662 --> 00:32:13,965
No matter how much I think about it,
if Kim Chun Chu collapses,

346
00:32:15,100 --> 00:32:16,735
Silla will also be finished.

347
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:23,075
I will no longer seek you out.

348
00:32:24,943 --> 00:32:28,814
Are you certain the first animal
you saw today was a pig?

349
00:32:29,414 --> 00:32:30,749
I am certain.

350
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:35,620
I hunted it in the mountains,
removed the hair, and brought it at once.

351
00:32:36,521 --> 00:32:38,323
A pig of the woods.

352
00:32:40,692 --> 00:32:43,895
Kim Chun Chu still has one chance.

353
00:32:49,434 --> 00:32:53,638
If a tiger cries in the north,
a dragon will fly from the North Star.

354
00:32:54,072 --> 00:33:00,045
Then the wood pig will become light
in Kim Chun Chu's darkness,

355
00:33:00,846 --> 00:33:01,980
and Silla...

356
00:33:04,216 --> 00:33:05,417
will survive.

357
00:33:12,691 --> 00:33:14,226
Interesting.

358
00:33:29,741 --> 00:33:32,277
Beop Min, what brings you here?

359
00:33:33,845 --> 00:33:37,349
Are you now leaving the matter of sending
private soldiers to a fortune-teller?

360
00:33:37,816 --> 00:33:39,251
Of course not.

361
00:33:40,519 --> 00:33:43,388
You may deny it,
but you are just like your father.

362
00:33:43,455 --> 00:33:47,259
Why do you think so many steps ahead
and make things complicated?

363
00:33:47,859 --> 00:33:49,361
It is not about the fortune.

364
00:33:49,428 --> 00:33:51,363
I came because I have taken
an interest in the shaman.

365
00:33:51,830 --> 00:33:53,865
She is the most beautiful in Seorabeol.

366
00:33:54,699 --> 00:33:56,835
I thought you were someone...

367
00:33:57,636 --> 00:33:59,905
who would be standing in the middle
of a battlefield, not beside a shaman.

368
00:34:03,975 --> 00:34:07,112
In that strange family of yours,
you are the one I relate to the most.

369
00:34:07,179 --> 00:34:09,181
Do you think I do not know how you feel?

370
00:34:10,115 --> 00:34:15,754
I am doing this because I also want
to escape this miserable situation.

371
00:34:18,423 --> 00:34:20,225
Please send your private troops
to Daeyaseong.

372
00:34:25,630 --> 00:34:26,832
Enjoy!

373
00:34:42,881 --> 00:34:44,282
(Dancing without music)

374
00:34:47,185 --> 00:34:48,186
Lord Seon Pum.

375
00:34:49,754 --> 00:34:51,423
It states, "Geumseong Jakmu."

376
00:34:51,490 --> 00:34:52,491
(Geumseong Jakmu: to dance without music)

377
00:34:56,161 --> 00:34:58,597
Come on.

378
00:34:58,663 --> 00:34:59,831
Dancing, of all things?

379
00:35:00,565 --> 00:35:03,268
Is it not inappropriate to dance now?

380
00:35:14,513 --> 00:35:17,349
Go for it.

381
00:35:17,415 --> 00:35:19,050
How amusing.

382
00:35:38,503 --> 00:35:41,473
How can you play games
with a juryeonggu dice in this crisis?

383
00:35:45,744 --> 00:35:47,345
The Minister of Military Affairs
ordered you to send troops...

384
00:35:47,412 --> 00:35:48,813
a long time ago.

385
00:35:49,481 --> 00:35:50,482
Kid.

386
00:35:51,049 --> 00:35:54,386
The troops in Seorabeol do not move
by the Minister of Military Affairs.

387
00:35:54,452 --> 00:35:56,855
- It is the Hwabaek Council...
- Convene the Hwabaek Council at once.

388
00:35:57,722 --> 00:35:59,090
Forget the Hwabaek Council.

389
00:36:01,426 --> 00:36:05,497
Your sister Go Ta So is in danger.
Of course, we must act.

390
00:36:06,932 --> 00:36:10,001
General Su Se should have finished
his preparations to march by now.

391
00:36:11,469 --> 00:36:12,537
He is only leaving now?

392
00:36:19,177 --> 00:36:20,745
If anything happens
to Daeyaseong Fortress,

393
00:36:24,182 --> 00:36:25,884
I will not let it slide.

394
00:36:38,430 --> 00:36:39,531
Yubeom gonggwa.

395
00:36:39,598 --> 00:36:42,100
(Yubeom gonggwa:
Stay still even when provoked)

396
00:36:45,370 --> 00:36:46,871
I will let it slide this time.

397
00:36:52,744 --> 00:36:56,181
Think carefully
about why your father is doing nothing.

398
00:36:57,315 --> 00:37:00,352
He realized his grave mistake
of leaving Daeyaseong,

399
00:37:00,418 --> 00:37:02,487
and that is why he is lying low.

400
00:37:03,788 --> 00:37:07,459
You should also keep a low profile.

401
00:37:09,527 --> 00:37:11,730
I will not be this kind next time.

402
00:37:46,998 --> 00:37:49,267
(Daeyaseong)

403
00:38:11,022 --> 00:38:12,290
Oh, no...

404
00:38:16,261 --> 00:38:18,129
While we were putting out fires,

405
00:38:18,196 --> 00:38:21,066
we were surrounded by the Baekje troops
that crossed the river.

406
00:38:21,132 --> 00:38:24,669
And there is no word
of reinforcements from Seorabeol.

407
00:38:25,970 --> 00:38:27,639
The men have starved for days.

408
00:38:28,640 --> 00:38:30,308
Their morale must be at rock bottom.

409
00:38:30,375 --> 00:38:34,412
General, what are you saying?
We can still fight.

410
00:38:36,681 --> 00:38:38,416
I cannot become a prisoner
of Baekje again.

411
00:38:41,252 --> 00:38:46,024
If I must die for losing the fortress,
let me die by the blade of Silla.

412
00:38:46,858 --> 00:38:48,359
They will not pursue us.

413
00:38:48,426 --> 00:38:50,662
How can you trust their word and retreat?

414
00:38:51,963 --> 00:38:53,832
Rather than begging for life like a rat,

415
00:38:54,232 --> 00:38:56,901
it is better to die fighting like a tiger.

416
00:39:00,638 --> 00:39:01,639
Juk Juk.

417
00:39:03,742 --> 00:39:04,843
This is all my fault.

418
00:39:06,244 --> 00:39:07,245
Even so,

419
00:39:08,213 --> 00:39:10,615
must we not save the people of Silla?

420
00:39:14,652 --> 00:39:15,720
Let us go and live!

421
00:39:15,787 --> 00:39:17,021
No!

422
00:39:18,490 --> 00:39:20,358
If you want to leave, go ahead.

423
00:39:21,259 --> 00:39:23,261
I will stay and fight until the end.

424
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:05,770
I will defend this place until the end,
so do not worry and go save Silla.

425
00:40:07,972 --> 00:40:10,909
All right, I will see you soon.

426
00:40:43,942 --> 00:40:45,743
How dare you, Yun Chung?

427
00:41:01,159 --> 00:41:05,230
I have been fooled again by Baekje.

428
00:41:24,849 --> 00:41:27,819
You dog! You sold out your country!

429
00:41:38,162 --> 00:41:39,530
Watch closely.

430
00:41:42,166 --> 00:41:45,103
I am General Geom Il of Baekje!

431
00:41:45,169 --> 00:41:49,374
The souls of the Silla people who died
because of you will never forgive you!

432
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:54,145
You talk too much.

433
00:41:55,813 --> 00:41:56,814
Kill her.

434
00:41:59,417 --> 00:42:01,953
The people of Silla
do not bow to the enemy.

435
00:42:03,421 --> 00:42:04,422
Kill me!

436
00:42:05,089 --> 00:42:07,425
Silla will never let this go!

437
00:42:09,627 --> 00:42:11,930
It is a pity I will not get to see
your father's humiliation.

438
00:42:12,830 --> 00:42:17,302
However, your head
will cloud your father's judgment,

439
00:42:17,635 --> 00:42:19,537
and Silla will eventually be destroyed.

440
00:42:21,973 --> 00:42:23,107
Never.

441
00:42:25,209 --> 00:42:26,311
Father,

442
00:42:27,011 --> 00:42:31,616
look at my head
and make sure you crush Baekje!

443
00:42:43,361 --> 00:42:47,398
Mother, Father...

444
00:43:29,007 --> 00:43:31,309
(Kim Mun Hui,
Kim Chun Chu's wife, Kim Yu Sin's sister)

445
00:43:41,252 --> 00:43:42,253
Mother!

446
00:43:42,754 --> 00:43:44,255
Mother...

447
00:43:44,889 --> 00:43:48,926
Her Excellency has collapsed.
Quickly, call a physician!

448
00:43:48,993 --> 00:43:49,994
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

449
00:44:54,492 --> 00:44:55,560
No.

450
00:44:57,829 --> 00:44:59,597
This is not my sister.

451
00:45:06,571 --> 00:45:08,706
Father, that is not her, right?

452
00:45:09,373 --> 00:45:10,374
Is it?

453
00:45:12,110 --> 00:45:15,113
Please say something.
Tell me that is not Go Ta So!

454
00:46:30,221 --> 00:46:31,355
My child...

455
00:46:35,793 --> 00:46:36,894
My baby...

456
00:46:40,364 --> 00:46:41,365
My daughter...

457
00:47:06,390 --> 00:47:09,293
(King Seong's shrine, Sabi, Baekje)

458
00:47:09,360 --> 00:47:11,729
I offer you the head of Kim Pum Seok.

459
00:47:22,840 --> 00:47:24,141
(Buyeo Yung, Baekje's Crown Prince)

460
00:47:24,208 --> 00:47:25,209
I,

461
00:47:26,010 --> 00:47:30,081
to the cruel King Jinheung
and Kim Mu Ryeok of Silla,

462
00:47:32,149 --> 00:47:37,321
have avenged His Majesty King Seong,
who was wrongfully beheaded.

463
00:47:38,589 --> 00:47:42,560
May your soul wandering
the underworld now rest in peace.

464
00:48:19,030 --> 00:48:21,699
- Long live, Your Majesty!
- Long live, Your Majesty!

465
00:48:26,404 --> 00:48:27,405
Your Majesty,

466
00:48:27,905 --> 00:48:32,343
you have captured Daeyaseong,
which was said to be impenetrable.

467
00:48:32,910 --> 00:48:34,712
Congratulations, Your Majesty!

468
00:48:35,313 --> 00:48:39,183
This is a gift from Yeon Gae So Mun.

469
00:48:41,485 --> 00:48:42,486
Yeon Gae So Mun...

470
00:48:42,853 --> 00:48:45,523
is the one who ultimately refused
your request for a joint attack.

471
00:48:46,057 --> 00:48:47,591
Why do you say it is his achievement?

472
00:48:48,359 --> 00:48:49,393
Prince.

473
00:48:49,827 --> 00:48:50,828
Yes, Your Majesty.

474
00:48:51,228 --> 00:48:54,198
Yeon Gae So Mun
did not send his troops directly.

475
00:48:55,032 --> 00:48:58,769
But did he not deceive Silla
with a false dispatch of troops?

476
00:49:00,338 --> 00:49:04,775
If Goguryeo reinforcements had come,
would we have been able to move...

477
00:49:05,843 --> 00:49:10,081
all our troops from Dangseong
and reach Daeyaseong so easily?

478
00:49:11,148 --> 00:49:13,784
And all while trusting
the words of Geom Il of Silla.

479
00:49:15,853 --> 00:49:21,125
We learned about Yeon Gae So Mun and
took Daeyaseong Fortress from Silla.

480
00:49:22,927 --> 00:49:23,961
Is this not...

481
00:49:25,730 --> 00:49:27,732
a great success?

482
00:49:31,202 --> 00:49:34,805
Once we pass Chogye and Okmungok Valley,
we will reach the Hwangsan River.

483
00:49:34,872 --> 00:49:38,843
Then we can strike Seorabeol immediately.

484
00:49:39,477 --> 00:49:41,545
We will head to Okmungok at once.

485
00:49:42,046 --> 00:49:43,347
Soldiers!

486
00:49:43,881 --> 00:49:46,417
What are you so happy about?

487
00:49:48,886 --> 00:49:49,987
(Queen Mother Sataek,
King Uija's stepmother)

488
00:49:50,054 --> 00:49:54,458
Is the rumor
that you sent food for 50,000 men...

489
00:49:54,525 --> 00:49:55,626
to Yeon Gae So Mun true?

490
00:49:55,693 --> 00:49:56,894
Was it for 50,000 men?

491
00:49:57,461 --> 00:49:58,496
(Sataek Ji Jeok, Baekje's Chief Minister)

492
00:49:58,562 --> 00:50:00,931
Your Majesty, did you say 50,000?

493
00:50:01,565 --> 00:50:03,167
I have captured a fortress...

494
00:50:03,834 --> 00:50:06,804
far more precious than food
for 50,000 men.

495
00:50:06,871 --> 00:50:10,708
Silla will soon be in our hands.

496
00:50:10,775 --> 00:50:13,577
Your Highness, the order is wrong.

497
00:50:14,111 --> 00:50:15,980
You have not even repaid the food...

498
00:50:16,046 --> 00:50:18,115
you borrowed from the Sataek family
for the 50,000 soldiers,

499
00:50:18,182 --> 00:50:21,285
yet you want
to give 50,000 more to Yeon Gae So Mun?

500
00:50:21,652 --> 00:50:26,524
I have never forgotten the kindness
of the Sataek family for a moment.

501
00:50:26,590 --> 00:50:28,092
This victory...

502
00:50:28,159 --> 00:50:32,596
was possible, thanks to the Queen Mother
and her family, was it not?

503
00:50:33,097 --> 00:50:39,870
Your Majesty, I will repay that kindness
with the spoils of the war against Silla.

504
00:50:39,937 --> 00:50:43,707
From now on, like the previous kings did,
when it comes to raising a large army,

505
00:50:47,711 --> 00:50:51,182
please discuss it with me first.

506
00:50:56,921 --> 00:50:59,924
I have something to say to you in private,
so step outside for a moment, Yung.

507
00:51:01,826 --> 00:51:04,962
You all step out as well.
I have orders to give.

508
00:51:33,858 --> 00:51:36,393
(King Bojang, 28th ruler of Goguryeo)

509
00:51:43,567 --> 00:51:50,040
Preserving the lineage of those in
the frontier is Tang's noble tradition.

510
00:51:50,941 --> 00:51:51,942
(Ko Jeong Eui, Goguryeo's general)

511
00:51:52,009 --> 00:51:54,778
The succession of the throne
of distant lands...

512
00:51:54,845 --> 00:51:57,281
has been Tang's tradition for generations.

513
00:51:59,550 --> 00:52:03,654
King Bojang of Goguryeo,
whose virtue is widely acclaimed...

514
00:52:03,721 --> 00:52:05,389
and whose loyalty is beyond question,

515
00:52:05,456 --> 00:52:07,458
shall be bestowed with the titles...

516
00:52:07,525 --> 00:52:14,365
as Lord of Liaodong of Shangzhou
and King of Goguryeo.

517
00:52:15,599 --> 00:52:18,035
His Majesty King Bojang of Goguryeo...

518
00:52:18,102 --> 00:52:20,471
Interpret exactly what they said.

519
00:52:27,845 --> 00:52:31,115
Since Bojang is virtuous and loyal,
like the late king,

520
00:52:31,615 --> 00:52:34,251
I grant him the title...

521
00:52:35,085 --> 00:52:36,754
of Lord of Liaodong of Shangzhou
and King of Goguryeo.

522
00:52:39,089 --> 00:52:40,925
The King of Goguryeo...

523
00:52:40,991 --> 00:52:45,963
shall receive the edict
after showing proper imperial courtesy.

524
00:52:46,564 --> 00:52:50,100
The King of Goguryeo shall first pay
his respects to His Imperial Majesty...

525
00:52:50,167 --> 00:52:51,168
before receiving the edict.

526
00:52:54,638 --> 00:52:57,608
I clearly sent a message in my name.

527
00:52:58,442 --> 00:53:00,844
Is there no mention of me?

528
00:53:05,115 --> 00:53:06,183
Supreme Commander,

529
00:53:07,251 --> 00:53:10,754
this is not the time for such things
to be included in the edict.

530
00:53:30,608 --> 00:53:31,642
Be quiet.

531
00:53:35,379 --> 00:53:41,819
Yeon Gae So Mun, Supreme Commander
and Grand Chancellor of Goguryeo,

532
00:53:41,885 --> 00:53:48,692
asks whether Your Imperial Majesty
has any words to convey to him.

533
00:53:50,694 --> 00:53:54,598
His Imperial Majesty
does not entertain mere generals.

534
00:53:59,603 --> 00:54:00,738
The Emperor...

535
00:54:02,673 --> 00:54:04,775
does not deal with Goguryeo generals.

536
00:54:19,023 --> 00:54:22,526
If the King of Goguryeo does not pay
his respects right now,

537
00:54:22,593 --> 00:54:25,829
I shall return and report this
as a blatant act of disloyalty.

538
00:54:26,196 --> 00:54:28,899
If the King of Goguryeo does not
show his respects immediately...

539
00:54:57,628 --> 00:55:01,799
Your Majesty, this is an edict sent
by Li Shimin, the Emperor of Tang.

540
00:55:02,232 --> 00:55:05,536
Please come forward,
pay your respects, and receive it.

541
00:55:07,971 --> 00:55:08,972
I understand.

542
00:55:31,528 --> 00:55:32,529
Your Majesty.

543
00:55:33,630 --> 00:55:36,366
The officials of Goguryeo are watching.

544
00:56:13,604 --> 00:56:20,477
Do not oppose my words
in front of the enemy ever again.

545
00:56:24,815 --> 00:56:25,816
Your Majesty.

546
00:56:44,968 --> 00:56:45,969
Your Majesty!

547
00:56:46,370 --> 00:56:49,907
We cannot just watch Yeon Gae So Mun,

548
00:56:49,973 --> 00:56:52,309
who brutally murdered Ko Geon Mu,
whom Your Majesty had appointed.

549
00:56:52,376 --> 00:56:55,045
General Li Shiji is absolutely right.

550
00:56:55,112 --> 00:56:59,516
Your Majesty, a coup that lacks
justification will not last long.

551
00:57:00,017 --> 00:57:03,587
The lords of the fortresses in Liaodong
are not following Yeon Gae So Mun.

552
00:57:04,054 --> 00:57:07,724
Goguryeo will spill its own blood
and collapse.

553
00:57:07,791 --> 00:57:08,792
Your Majesty!

554
00:57:09,393 --> 00:57:11,662
Yeon Gae So Mun is a man
who lives by the sword.

555
00:57:11,728 --> 00:57:14,031
One day, he will surely stand
against Your Majesty.

556
00:57:14,298 --> 00:57:17,167
It is only natural to eliminate him now.

557
00:57:17,234 --> 00:57:19,336
Do not forget Wei Zheng's humble counsel.

558
00:57:19,403 --> 00:57:21,505
Think of the people who are tired of war.

559
00:57:21,572 --> 00:57:25,843
Spare bloodshed now
for the sake of a hundred-year legacy.

560
00:57:25,909 --> 00:57:27,010
What?

561
00:57:42,759 --> 00:57:43,760
Wei Zheng...

562
00:57:47,698 --> 00:57:50,634
When I was fighting
my brother for the throne,

563
00:57:52,903 --> 00:57:54,371
he was my brother's strategist.

564
00:57:57,608 --> 00:58:00,844
Wei Zheng told my brother to kill me.

565
00:58:03,614 --> 00:58:07,050
After I rose to the throne,
I summoned Wei Zheng and asked him,

566
00:58:08,719 --> 00:58:10,821
"Why did you want to kill me so badly?"

567
00:58:12,256 --> 00:58:13,991
Then Wei Zheng said this,

568
00:58:15,325 --> 00:58:19,396
"I am a loyal subject of your brother,
Crown Prince Li Jiancheng."

569
00:58:20,264 --> 00:58:23,533
"As a subject, advising him to eliminate
his most formidable enemy"...

570
00:58:23,600 --> 00:58:25,302
"is only natural."

571
00:58:33,977 --> 00:58:35,012
Who among you!

572
00:58:35,946 --> 00:58:38,348
Who among you can risk your life
like Wei Zheng...

573
00:58:39,816 --> 00:58:41,785
and speak the truth to me?

574
00:58:49,426 --> 00:58:53,697
Your Majesty,
Chancellor Wei Zheng has passed away.

575
00:59:03,206 --> 00:59:04,241
What?

576
00:59:05,275 --> 00:59:06,910
Wei Zheng has passed away?

577
00:59:54,391 --> 00:59:56,960
(Ko Yeon Mu, Goguryeo's general)

578
01:00:01,131 --> 01:00:04,034
How dare you put me in such disgrace?

579
01:00:08,271 --> 01:00:09,339
Kill me instead.

580
01:00:16,713 --> 01:00:18,982
Is death all you want?

581
01:00:19,916 --> 01:00:23,553
There are already more than enough
who have died.

582
01:00:28,058 --> 01:00:29,092
Look.

583
01:00:32,229 --> 01:00:35,799
He is the hero of Goguryeo
who defeated the Sui Dynasty.

584
01:00:38,602 --> 01:00:40,704
Must you go this far?

585
01:00:40,771 --> 01:00:44,741
If he had remained a hero of the past,
he would not have ended up like this.

586
01:00:45,642 --> 01:00:47,477
He was a hero yesterday,

587
01:00:48,278 --> 01:00:51,615
but today, he lies dead like that.

588
01:00:51,681 --> 01:00:53,050
You madman.

589
01:00:55,118 --> 01:00:56,119
Kill me.

590
01:00:58,155 --> 01:01:00,424
A general who fails to protect his post...

591
01:01:01,925 --> 01:01:03,660
must die according to the law.

592
01:01:11,902 --> 01:01:13,170
Let me ask you.

593
01:01:14,371 --> 01:01:18,075
Are you the general only to Ko Geon Mu
or the general of Goguryeo?

594
01:01:19,543 --> 01:01:23,780
If you still have any loyalty
left for Goguryeo,

595
01:01:38,728 --> 01:01:41,665
you should abandon the thought of dying
for a man like him.

596
01:01:42,499 --> 01:01:44,201
Goguryeo today...

597
01:01:45,635 --> 01:01:48,038
needs a brave warrior like you.

598
01:01:51,775 --> 01:01:52,809
Please.

599
01:01:57,914 --> 01:01:58,915
Please...

600
01:02:03,787 --> 01:02:05,655
Please bury...

601
01:02:07,524 --> 01:02:08,625
His Majesty's head, at least.

602
01:02:11,461 --> 01:02:12,729
Raise your head!

603
01:02:20,003 --> 01:02:24,107
I will show him special respect.

604
01:02:25,909 --> 01:02:28,979
A great turmoil is coming to this land.

605
01:02:30,480 --> 01:02:32,616
No matter how much you wish not to fight,

606
01:02:33,183 --> 01:02:36,853
a great war, the likes of which
this land has never seen, will begin.

607
01:02:41,858 --> 01:02:43,293
Do you not hear that?

608
01:02:44,761 --> 01:02:47,264
The silent and majestic...

609
01:02:48,632 --> 01:02:50,167
sound of war.

610
01:02:52,636 --> 01:02:54,871
I can smell it on the wind.

611
01:02:56,540 --> 01:02:58,775
The smell of the sorrowful blood...

612
01:03:00,710 --> 01:03:02,379
shed by countless soldiers.

613
01:03:28,805 --> 01:03:31,775
Supreme Commander, I am Ko Hye Jin,
southern provincial governor of Goguryeo.

614
01:03:32,275 --> 01:03:34,544
When you were exiled to Liaodong,

615
01:03:35,078 --> 01:03:39,883
my father, General Ko Chung San,
was the one who helped you.

616
01:03:41,051 --> 01:03:42,052
Supreme Commander!

617
01:03:43,486 --> 01:03:47,090
Please, if you will only spare
the lives of my father and family...

618
01:04:18,655 --> 01:04:19,689
Wei Zheng...

619
01:04:21,491 --> 01:04:24,861
I have lost the mirror
that reflects my wrongdoings.

620
01:04:28,732 --> 01:04:29,833
Like Wei Zheng,

621
01:04:32,369 --> 01:04:35,772
who else will risk their life to stop me?

622
01:05:15,211 --> 01:05:16,846
Surely, he is not...

623
01:05:34,264 --> 01:05:35,265
Beop Min.

624
01:05:40,236 --> 01:05:41,938
Where on earth have you been?

625
01:05:42,238 --> 01:05:43,239
Where is Father?

626
01:05:55,085 --> 01:05:57,487
(Baekje)

627
01:06:03,126 --> 01:06:04,361
(Goguryeo)

628
01:06:14,070 --> 01:06:16,005
(Baekje)

629
01:06:22,712 --> 01:06:25,115
What kind of scheme are you plotting now?

630
01:06:26,983 --> 01:06:28,084
Have you been drinking?

631
01:06:32,455 --> 01:06:34,724
Go Ta So's soul has not even departed yet,

632
01:06:36,793 --> 01:06:39,195
but are you already
calculating your next move?

633
01:06:39,996 --> 01:06:41,064
That is what I am asking.

634
01:06:41,131 --> 01:06:42,732
You cannot control your emotions.

635
01:06:42,799 --> 01:06:44,033
- Leave.
- Yes.

636
01:06:44,868 --> 01:06:46,870
I am going mad with rage!

637
01:06:49,639 --> 01:06:50,974
But Father, how can you...

638
01:06:52,876 --> 01:06:54,444
be so calm?

639
01:06:54,844 --> 01:06:56,679
You coveted the power
of Kim Pum Seok's family,

640
01:06:57,747 --> 01:07:00,216
which is why you married
Go Ta So off to them.

641
01:07:02,619 --> 01:07:03,620
Why did you...

642
01:07:06,623 --> 01:07:09,592
refuse to marry Seon Pum's daughter?

643
01:07:13,797 --> 01:07:15,131
It is because I am sick and tired...

644
01:07:15,598 --> 01:07:18,234
of Jingol nobles who only care
about family status and not the person.

645
01:07:18,802 --> 01:07:20,703
I did not expect my father
to be just like them.

646
01:07:20,770 --> 01:07:22,472
If you think everything is wrong,

647
01:07:22,539 --> 01:07:25,775
what can you possibly change
by doing nothing like you are now?

648
01:07:26,543 --> 01:07:28,478
Will you just watch
as the Jingol nobles...

649
01:07:29,479 --> 01:07:32,182
only feed their own greed
and eat away at this country?

650
01:07:35,819 --> 01:07:38,455
Must we not set Silla right,
even if it means...

651
01:07:38,521 --> 01:07:40,623
we claim power through bloodshed?

652
01:07:43,226 --> 01:07:45,728
Just say that you want to be king!

653
01:07:53,436 --> 01:07:57,574
How dare you speak such high treason!

654
01:08:04,347 --> 01:08:06,916
(Sword & Silence)

655
01:08:35,245 --> 01:08:38,181
Send me to Goguryeo as an envoy.

656
01:08:38,982 --> 01:08:40,216
It is my fault.

657
01:08:41,084 --> 01:08:42,519
I should have been the one to die.

658
01:08:42,585 --> 01:08:45,355
Yeon Gae So Mun
will surely try to kill you.

659
01:08:45,421 --> 01:08:48,358
When Go Ta So died, I died too.

660
01:08:48,424 --> 01:08:49,425
Could it be?

661
01:08:49,692 --> 01:08:51,194
I will protect it.

662
01:08:51,261 --> 01:08:52,695
I will surely do so.

663
01:08:52,762 --> 01:08:55,031
If you join hands with Silla now,

664
01:08:55,098 --> 01:08:57,567
any enemy of Goguryeo
will also be an enemy of Silla.

665
01:08:57,634 --> 01:09:00,036
How dare you!

666
01:09:04,607 --> 01:09:06,609
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
